          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Digi Yatra Builds AI-Powered E-Passport Enrolment System for International Travel Using Facial Verification",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "The Digi Yatra Foundation has revealed new details of a proposed international travel system that combines e-passport enrolment, AI-powered facial verification, and token-based digital identity sharing at border checkpoints. The system aims to extend India's domestic airport biometric check-in infrastructure to cross-border travel, potentially affecting tens of millions of Indian passport holders. Privacy advocates have flagged concerns about data storage, biometric consent, and interoperability with foreign immigration systems.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-digi-yatra-e-passport-global-travel/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
